{
  "label": "yasufirsthall",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label yasufirsthall:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yasuhall1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yasuhall1.webp",
      "alt": "yasuhall1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, Yasu. Having fun spending your free time just...standing in the middle of the hall?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not sure if I would call it fun, but Touka will not let me into the room right now.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If you have any suggestions for a better way to spend my time, I would be happy to hear them.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I wouldn’t mind talking to you for a little bit. I’m sure it will keep the both of us at least mildly...entertained?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I entertain you?",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think you go a little beyond that, but saying “entertain” is probably the easiest way to describe it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do I remind you of the snow on the ground? The wind in the trees?",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No. You remind me of a girl who likely needs professional help but will not receive any.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What a strangely specific type of girl.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that what you would call your “type?”",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you hitting on me right now?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Romance is out of the question until my wings grow in, Sensei. For now, I am just trying to evaluate you.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It will come in handy soon.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why?...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yasuhall2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yasuhall2.webp",
      "alt": "yasuhall2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because soon, you’ll finally be ready to see where I’ve been hiding all this time.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Where I found solace when the world would not have me.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that just a really convoluted way of saying that you prefer cold weather over the heat?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yasuhall3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yasuhall3.webp",
      "alt": "yasuhall3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I both love and hate the summer at the same time.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s quite complicated. I can’t really talk about it here.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why? You’re not going to tell me a top secret organization is conducting a surveillance mission on you or something, right?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s something a crazy person would say.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So you are going to tell me that...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yasuhall4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yasuhall4.webp",
      "alt": "yasuhall4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If we talk too loudly about things we’re not allowed to talk about yet, the floor will open up and swallow us.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, that’s not a thing that happens.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yasuhall1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yasuhall1.webp",
      "alt": "yasuhall1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you sure?",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Yes?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I saw it with my own eyes, Sensei. The reckoning.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The hole that swallowed everything.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The...hole that-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, you’re not talking about Kumon-mi Academy, are you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yasuhall5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yasuhall5.webp",
      "alt": "yasuhall5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Slip.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Is that a yes or a no?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s an answer.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": One I can share with you the moment you open your eyes.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": When will you be ready to open your eyes?",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I really wish you’d stop asking me that while I’m looking directly at you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": When will you be ready to be saved, Sensei?",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": When will you be ready to be cleansed?",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Cleansed of what, exactly?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yasuhall6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yasuhall6.webp",
      "alt": "yasuhall6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": All of the filth this world has to offer.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Let us wash it all away together.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know, I’m normally the type to jump at an opportunity to shower with a cute girl, but I have a feeling I might not ever make it back if I accept this offer right now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Make it back to where? It’s not as if this place is of any value to either of us.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s so much harder to feel the ground tremble from up on the second floor.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Even if you lay down and press your cheek against the carpet of this very hall, you’d be lucky to feel anything at all.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please don’t put your face on the carpet here. I don’t think it’s vacuumed very often.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yasuhall7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yasuhall7.webp",
      "alt": "yasuhall7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Will agreeing to your demands bring you closer to the desire for salvation?",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, but it will keep you from getting dirty.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That which is white can never be dirty.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That is very much not true, Yasu.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": In fact, I’d say it’s the complete opposite.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s a nice dress and you wouldn’t want it to get ruined.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yasuhall8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yasuhall8.webp",
      "alt": "yasuhall8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nice?...",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei...",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This dress is hideous.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I want to tear it off right now.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know, I tried giving you a compliment and being a nice guy, but then you went and said that. And now I’m stuck questioning my morals like I always am.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yasuhall9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yasuhall9.webp",
      "alt": "yasuhall9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The funny thing about morals is that they are focused on what is right and what is wrong.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes. That is absolutely hilarious.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But when we are nothing more than subjects for who we believe created us, aren’t morals rather silly?",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If I think something is right and you think something is wrong, but we are both virtuous in our beliefs, which one of us is truly right?",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s a good point. If everything is subjective then-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yasuhall10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yasuhall10.webp",
      "alt": "yasuhall10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": BZZZT! Wrong answer!",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yasuhall5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yasuhall5.webp",
      "alt": "yasuhall5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My answer is the truly right one! Yours will only make the pain worse!",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The solution is to follow my lead! To see the things I see as right as virtuous in your own, tainted purified eyes.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Does your vision ever get cloudy, Sensei?",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tell me all of the horrible things you see, and I will swallow them whole.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yasuhall11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yasuhall11.webp",
      "alt": "yasuhall11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I will swallow anything and everything that you ask of me.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yasuhall12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yasuhall12.webp",
      "alt": "yasuhall12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Same.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thanks, Kirin. I had a feeling you were going to chime in there.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That girl is fucking weird, Sensei. Come hang out with me and Noriko instead.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe some other time...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you ready?",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": For...the swallowing?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": For the sanctuary.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": For the place that can not be swallowed by the hole that swallows everything.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A place where we can cleanse ourselves together...and hide when the heat becomes too much for our pitiful bodies to bear.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A place where God does not live, but very much likes to visit when the time is right.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I want to show you that place, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It sounds a lot like you’re inviting me to a church right now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yasuhall13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yasuhall13.webp",
      "alt": "yasuhall13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You actually are inviting me to a church aren’t you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yasuhall14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yasuhall14.webp",
      "alt": "yasuhall14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’d be very happy if you came.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just want to help you.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t think so, Yasu. I’m not really a religious person.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yasuhall8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yasuhall8.webp",
      "alt": "yasuhall8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then why do you reek of a shrine?",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": First off, rude.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Second, shrines don’t have a scent.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yasuhall7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yasuhall7.webp",
      "alt": "yasuhall7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But gods do. And I am very very very very very very very very very very very good when it comes to sniffing out things like that, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Yasu",
      "spkColor": "#74D9E9",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I wouldn’t mind showing up to hang out with you I guess, but...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, hold on. This is a bad idea. I shouldn’t be going to see you in a place like a church where there are other people around.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
